{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A boy who ran away from home.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He settles beneath a bridge, spending his days busking.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this new routine, he experiences new encounters and small, unexpected happenings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Why did he leave home?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And what will await him at the end of this short journey?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enjoy a story that feels like a short musical film, capturing a boy\u2019s fleeting journey.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877090/extras/5efce55b597dbe5bd44bf97716150600.avif?t=1759919338\" width=1560 height=423 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A short experience <strong>under 2 hours</strong>, combining <strong>Visual Novel, Rhythm, and Adventure.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It features a linear story to follow along,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >enriched with mini-games such as the rhythm game [Busking] and the music puzzle [Songwriting].</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Quiet and Restrained Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This script is based on the developer\u2019s real life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It doesn\u2019t try to force emotion\u2014</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >it simply unfolds in a calm yet honest way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>An Original Live Acoustic OST</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All tracks are written, composed, performed, and recorded by the developer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the protagonist\u2019s own songs to in-world \u201chit songs\u201d performed on busking stages,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >experience music that connects directly with the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Solo Development</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every illustration, every line of writing, and every piece of music was created by the developer alone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Because this story is entirely mine, I wanted it to be told only through me.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3877090?t=1759919338","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3877090?t=1759919338","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877090/305ae91f57019b5a8d7dbce5e81179c99deb656f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759919338","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877090/305ae91f57019b5a8d7dbce5e81179c99deb656f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759919338","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4004220,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A boy who ran away from home.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He settles beneath a bridge, spending his days busking.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this new routine, he experiences new encounters and small, unexpected happenings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Why did he leave home?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And what will await him at the end of this short journey?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enjoy a story that feels like a short musical film, capturing a boy\u2019s fleeting journey.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877090/extras/5efce55b597dbe5bd44bf97716150600.avif?t=1759919338\" width=1560 height=423 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A short experience <strong>under 2 hours</strong>, combining <strong>Visual Novel, Rhythm, and Adventure.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It features a linear story to follow along,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >enriched with mini-games such as the rhythm game [Busking] and the music puzzle [Songwriting].</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Quiet and Restrained Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This script is based on the developer\u2019s real life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It doesn\u2019t try to force emotion\u2014</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >it simply unfolds in a calm yet honest way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>An Original Live Acoustic OST</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All tracks are written, composed, performed, and recorded by the developer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the protagonist\u2019s own songs to in-world \u201chit songs\u201d performed on busking stages,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >experience music that connects directly with the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Solo Development</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every illustration, every line of writing, and every piece of music was created by the developer alone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Because this story is entirely mine, I wanted it to be told only through me.</p>","developers":["Mr.Spoon"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.c